 INPUT CARD>!   BFGS Hessian update, plausibly explaining both the runaway negative         
 INPUT CARD>!   curvature (TZVPP) and the erratic per-step SCF/gradient behaviour (TZVPPa). 
 INPUT CARD>!                                                                               
 INPUT CARD>! This version (b):                                                             
